  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "两个释放入口",
      "items": [
        "UE 请求释放：PDU Session Release Request (0xD1) 经 Nsmf_PDUSession_UpdateSMContext 携带 N1",
        "AMF 请求释放：Nsmf_PDUSession_ReleaseSMContext；不伪造成 HTTP DELETE",
        "两个入口都定位同一个已存在 Host Location / Owner Session，不创建新 SM Context"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Release OES 顺序",
      "items": [
        "r1 CA.DELETE_CHARGING（optional）→ r2 UPN.DELETE_UP_SESSION → r3 SSM.SIGNAL_UE_AN → r4 PA.DELETE_SM_POLICY → r5 SC.RELEASE_SM_CONTEXT → r6 SE.EMIT_EVENTS",
        "r3 是否需要 UE/RAN 信令由触发场景和 Profile 决定；若发出 Release Command，Release Complete 必须回到原 r3 occurrence",
        "r7 COMPENSATE_RELEASE 不作为普通 Skill Mutation；未知副作用通过 exact-original Reconcile 处理"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "资源与协议边界",
      "items": [
        "UPF Session Deletion 使用 PFCP Type 54/55，OpenAMSM 直连 UPF",
        "PCF Policy Association Delete 使用 Npcf_SMPolicyControl_Delete，经 SCP",
        "只有 Owner 释放与 Host 外部资源结算完成后，Host 才写入 URI Map tombstone"
      ]
    }
  ]
